Z||000000||Au nrod||04-30-2001||07:55 PM||||just a day or so ago, someone brought up the subject of to or not to restore his '84 iron duke. last winter i wrote an article to the poci (pontiac oakland club international) magazine. in it, i stated that if some of us do not keep our beloved fieros stock, just as they came from the factory, one day we would not know what the originals looked like. my article can be reviewed on  <IMG SRC="http://www.avolve.net/user/bhhum/otscar1.jpg">   and    <IMG SRC="http://www.avolve.net/user/bhhum/otscar11."> ||||reg||1
